{"3648730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blood Vial", "steam_appid": 3648730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>BLOOD VIAL </i></strong>is a vampiric, retro-inspired FPS with a leaking health bar. Swim through the blood of your fallen enemies to keep your vial full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Holy Ones have gained control. Reach the sacred source of power draining you of your energy, and destroy it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive through spilled blood to climb walls, swim through grates, and leap over gaps. Learn to harness your blood powers to their maximum potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get messy with the shotgun, or execute with precision using the revolver. Unlock more weapons and experiment with your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seal sacred pacts to gain power between each level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blood Vial</i> <i>was inspired by Post Void, Splatoon and Ultrakill.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>BLOOD VIAL </i></strong>is a vampiric, retro-inspired FPS with a leaking health bar. Swim through the blood of your fallen enemies to keep your vial full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Holy Ones have gained control. Reach the sacred source of power draining you of your energy, and destroy it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive through spilled blood to climb walls, swim through grates, and leap over gaps. Learn to harness your blood powers to their maximum potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get messy with the shotgun, or execute with precision using the revolver. Unlock more weapons and experiment with your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seal sacred pacts to gain power between each leve